diff --git a/demos/flow.dem b/demos/flow.dem
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..acc956b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/demos/flow.dem
@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+# flow.dem — Story 1.3: one packet flows source -> router -> sink, forwarded
+# per-hop. The 1.2 fixture is residential(0) <- router(1) -> content_host(2),
+# 12 tiles apart on row y=15. Draw source->router then router->sink at the
+# 'standard' tier (span 12 <= max 14); spawn one packet residential(0) ->
+# content_host(2) at 2050ms (tick 41 — after both pipes apply at ticks 11/31).
+#
+# The packet then traverses per-hop (bandwidth 30 vs standard cap 15 -> 2
+# ticks/edge): forward onto edge0 (t41), mid edge0 (t42), arrive router (t43),
+# forward onto edge1 (t44), mid edge1 (t45), deliver at sink (t46). Captures
+# pin a mid-edge frame on each pipe + the per-hop stop at the router junction.
+seed 42
+run 3000ms
+at 500ms draw 0 1 standard
+at 1500ms draw 1 2 standard
+at 2050ms spawn 0 2
+capture at 2100ms
+capture at 2150ms
+capture at 2250ms
+expect hash stable
